(1a)
1 oṃ namaḥ śrīgurave ।।

brahmaradhrasarasīruhodare nityalagnamavadātamadbhutaṃ ।
kuṇḍalīvicalakāṇḍamaṇḍite dvādaśāntasarasīruhaṃ bhaje ।। 1 ।।

tasya kandalitakandarodare yuktalekhamakathādirekhayā ।
koṇalakṣitahalakṣamaṇḍalabhāvayuktamavalālayaṃ bhaje ।। 2 ।।

tatpuṭe paṭutaḍitkarālimāsyarddhamānamaṇipāṭalaprabhaṃ ।
cintayāmi hṛdi cinmayaṃ vapurbbindunādamaṇipīṭhamaṇḍalaṃ ।। 3 ।।

urddhamabhyahutabhuksikhāsakhaṃ tadvilāsaparibrahmaṇāspadaṃ ।
viśvaghasmaramahotkatorbhutaṃ vyāmṛśāmi yugamādihaṃsayoḥ ।। 4 ।।

(1b)

tatra nāthacaraṇārabavindayoḥ kuṃkumāruṇajharīramandayoḥ ।
dvandvamindukarakaṃdaśītalaṃ mānasaṃ smarati maṃgalāspadaṃ ।। 5 ।।

nisaktamaṇipādukāṃ niyamitāghakolāhalaṃ ।
sphuratkiśalayāruṇaṃ nakhasamullasaccandikaṃ ।।
parāmṛtasarovaroditasarojaro visphurat ।
bhajāmi śirasi sthitaṃ gurupadāravindadvayaṃ ।। 6 ।।

pādukāṃ paṃcakaṃ stotraṃ paṃcavaktrādvinirgataḥ ।
śrīpacāmnāyaphaladaṃ prapaṃce cātidullabhaṃ ।। 8 ।।

।। iti śrīrudrayāmale pañcamakhaṇḍe śrīgurukopadeśaḥ samāptaḥ ।।

(2a)

1 śrīgurave namaḥ ।।

sadāśiveśvarārudro viṣṇubrahmāsanākulaḥ ।
gaurīśo trīśamitrīśoḥ kapilānandagurustataḥ ।।

siddhiśāsanapiṃgākhyo manuśca puṣpadantakaḥ ।
śāntinogastisaṃjñaśca paṃcārthākhya gurustataḥ ।।

vidyācāryyo vratācāryyo dūrvvāsā kauśiko mataḥ ।
jaigīśopi vratācāryya kauṇḍinyācāryya eva ca ।।

bhairavāṣṭakasaṃjñañca aṅgārakagurustathā ।
viśvanāthotha someśo vaśiṣṭho viśvarūpakaḥ ।।

gaṃgādharaguruścaiva śrīśaṃkaragurustathā ।
nārāyaṇapadāntena śrīmadvārādyavigrahaṃ ।।

guruśrīvimalānandedeśikendreti gīyate ।
(2b)
teṣāṃ pādaprasādena rāmānandaḥ prakīrttitaḥ ।।

gurupādaratastasmādbhairavānandasaṃjñakaḥ ।
ete vai paripāṭyoktāḥ pāśupatagurukrama ।।

svasvaśaktisamāyogāt nāmāmbā ca padāntikā ।
varābhayakarāsarvvaśivāditi gurukramaṃ ।।

gurukramaṃ paṭhedyastu trisaṃdhyaṃ śraddhayānvita ।
nyāsapūjājapādīnāṃ anantaphalamāpnuyāt ।। 8 ।।

।। iti śrīpāśupatagurukramaṃ samāptaṃ ।। ।।

1 oṃ namaḥ śivāya ।।

namaste nirmmalaṃ devaṃ namaste jñānarūpiṇaṃ ।
namaste jyotirūpañca niskalañca namo'stu te ।। 1 ।।

ādhāre tiṣṭhate jyotiḥ sūryyamaṇḍalabheditaṃ ।
(3a)
somacakrāntadūrddhañca tadūrddhañca śivārccanaṃ ।। 2 ।।

svaāsanastu karttavyaṃ padmāsanamanuttamaṃ ।
tatra maṃtrāsanaṃ kṛtvā pañcapretāsanaṃ śubhaṃ ।। 3 ।।

prāṇāyāmampravakṣyāmi svādhāre yojitaṃ japet ।
brahmā tu pūrakaṃ yasya kumbhako viṣṇudevatāḥ ।। 4 ।।

recakāgnisvarūpañca śivaśaktisamuddhare ।
paścimābhimukhaṃ liṅgaṃ pūrako brahmamaṇḍalaṃ ।। 5 ।।

sādhakābhyāsayennityaṃ bhūtaśuddhiṃ samuttamaḥ ।
pāpaṃ haren mahādevi satyaṃ satyanna cānyathā ।। 6 ।।

śṛṇu devi mahātatvaṃ arghapātrastathāparaṃ ।
mūlādhāre sthitaṃ devi agnicakrañca durllabhaṃ ।। 7 ।।

(3b)

agniyonisthitāśakti kalādaśakarūpiṇīṃ ।
prasādābhayadātāraṃ agnirūpaṃ mahotsavaṃ ।। 8 ।।

hṛdaye tiṣṭhate nityaṃ sūryacakramanoharaṃ ।
dvādaśastu maheśāni śaktiṃ caiva suśobhanaṃ ।। 9 ।।

dvibhujāñca mahādevi varadābhayadhāriṇīṃ ।
evaṃmeṣā guṇā sarvvaṃ bālārkkaparameśvarīṃ ।। 10 ।।

brahmāṇḍasaṃsthitāṃ devi parāmbāmṛtarūpiṇīṃ ।
somacakramahādevi śaktiṣoḍaśadevatāṃ ।। 11 ।।

abhayo varahastaṃ ca muktābharaṇabhūṣitāṃ ।
amṛteśvarī mahādevī amṛtāya namo'stute ।। 12 ।।

ūrddhanāḍīhataṃ kṛtvā adhonāḍīnikuñcanāt ।
(4a)
madhyanāḍīsamādāya tarppayet khecarīparāṃ ।। 13 ।।

etatte kathitaṃ devi trailokyaṣvapi durllabhaṃ ।
evametatmahātatvaṃ pūjayet sādhakottamaḥ ।। 14 ।।

prāṇaṃ devī samārūḍhaṃ mādanaṃ śakrasaṃyutaṃ ।
madhyasthāśivamagniñca caturthasvarabhūṣitaṃ ।। 15 ।।

sākāśaṃ candrārddhanādaṃ jyotireko mahotsavaṃ ।
paścimābhimukhaṃntasya bhāgbhavaṃ parameśvarīṃ ।। 16 ।।

aruṇāruṇasaṃkāśāṃ pāśāṅkuśatrilocanāṃ ।
kapālañca valābhañca agnicakramanoharaṃ ।। 17 ।।

koṇabāhyaṃ sthitā devī kāmādāhlādirūpiṇīṃ ।
rudraśaktimahādevīṃ kāmeśvarī namo'stute ।। 18 ।।

(4b)

devyāsanasthitaṃ prāṇaṃ kandarpaśivasaṃyutaṃ ।
sahasrākṣamahādevi prāṇamagnitathaiva ca ।। 19 ।।

caturthasvarasaṃyuktaṃ biṃdukhaṇḍendvalaṃkṛtaṃ ।
kāmarājaṃ mahādevi jagatkṣobhaṃ prajāyate ।। 20 ।।

pakvabimvapratīkāśaṃ cāpeṣukādyadhāriṇīṃ ।
pāśāṅkuśadharāṃ devī mātuluṃgantathaiva ca ।। 21 ।।

sūryyacakrasthitāndevī pīṭhajālaṃdharantathā ।
viṣṇuśaktimahādevīṃ vajreśvari namo'stute ।। 22 ।।

devī madanamārūḍhaṃ indrabījaṃ niyojayet ।
madhastāśambhuragniñca bindukhaṇḍendvalaṃkṛtaṃ ।। 23 ।।
(5a)

śaktibījamahādevī turīyasvarabhūṣitaṃ ।
trikūṭañca mahādevī mahātripurasundarī ।। 24 ।।

caturbhujā triṇetrāñca caṃdrakoṭisamopamāṃ ।
pustakākṣadharīdevīṃ pāśāṅkuśakarodyatāṃ ।। 25 ।।

somacakraṃ mahādevī pūrṇapīṭhamanoharaṃ ।
brahmaśaktimahādevī bhageśvari namo'stute ।। 26 ।।

trikūṭāni samāhṛtya tridaśakṣaramuddharet ।
tūryabījamahādevī brahmakhaṇḍendvalaṃkṛtaṃ ।। 27 ।।

eṣā mantramahāvidyā parāmbā śaktirūpiṇīṃ ।
kūṭamekaṃ sthitaṃ devīṃ bhuktimuktiphalapradāṃ ।। 28 ।।

somasūryyāgnipīṭhañca dāḍimī kusumopamāṃ ।
(5b)
pāśāṅkuśatrinetrañca pañcabāṇadhanurddharāṃ ।। 29 ।।

brahmacakrasthitaṃ nityaṃ jñānaśaktisvarūpiṇīṃ ।
oḍiyānamahādevi saubhāgyāya namostute ।। 30 ।।

japaṃ kṛtvā mānasena koṭijāpaphalaṃ bhavet ।
paścimābhimukhaṃ liṅgaṃ bhuktimuktiphalapradaṃ ।। 31 ।।

trailokyamātā tvamasi tvameva viśvavyāpinī ।
tvameva śivatatvañca sarvvavratatvameva ca ।। 32 ।।

tvameva sarvvatīrthāni sarvvamantratvameva ca ।
tvameva sarvvadevāni tvameva śaktirūpiṇī ।। 33 ।।

rogasokahareddevī udvighnañca nivāriṇī ।
(6a)
avidyā labhate vidyāṃ duḥkhadāridranāśanī ।। 34 ।।

balidadyātpañcabhūtaṃ ātmapūjāṃ tathā punaḥ ।
dhyātvā pañcapretāni bhuktideyāt hutāśanaṃ ।। 35 ।।

śṛṇu devi mahājñānaṃ caitanyaṃ sarvvasāsvataṃ ।
yasya hṛdi pravarttante tasya jñānaṃ viniścayaṃ ।। 36 ।।

adyāpi śaraṇaṃ devi tvameva śaraṇaṃ mamaḥ ।
yatkāmaṃ prārthayennityaṃ dehi dehi maheśvari ।। 37 ।।

।। iti jyotisānandaḥ stavaḥ samāptaṃ ।।

śrīgurumūrtti jayati ।।

śrīīśvara uvāca ।।

kullukāṃ mūrddhni saṃjapya hṛdi setuṃ viritayet ।
mahāsetuvi{śu}ddhau tu sahasrāre samu{ddha}ret ।। 1 ।।
(6b)
maṇipūre tu nirvvāṇaṃ mahākuṇḍalinīmadhaḥ ।
svādhisthānaṃ kāmarājaṃ rākinī mūrddhni saṃsthitaṃ ।। 2 ।।

vicinte vidhivaddevi mūlādhārāṃtikāsthive ।
visuddhāntaṃ smareddevi visatantutanīyasīṃ ।। 3 ।।

devīsthānaṃ dvijihvāṃ taṃ mūlamantrāvṛtaṃ muhuḥ ।। ।।

śrīdevyuvāca ।।

kullakā kīdṛśī nātha seturvā deva kīdṛśaḥ ।। 4 ।।

kīdṛśo vā mahāseturnirvvāṇaṃtha * kīdṛśaṃ ।
anyarvvā kathitaṃ janme kidṛśaṃ tadvada prabho ।। 5 ।।

śrīīśvarovāca ।।

guhyāguhyataraṃ devi tava snehena kathyate ।
vinā yena maheśāni niḥphalaṃ tu japādikaṃ ।। 6 ।।
(7a)
tārāyāḥ kullukā devi mahānīlasarasvatī ।
paṃcākṣarī kālikāyāḥ kullukā parikathyate ।। 7 ।।

kālī kurccavadhurmāyā phadaṃtā parameśvari ।
chinnamastā maheśāni kullukāṣṭhākṣarī bhavet ।। 8 ।।

vajravairocanīye ca aṃtavermaprakīrttayet ।
saṃpatpadāyā prathamaṃ bhairavyāḥ kullukā matā ।। 9 ।।

śrīmattripurasuṃdaryyāḥ kullukā dvādaśākṣarī ।
vāgbhavaṃ prathamaṃ bījaṃ kāmarājaṃmanaṃtaraṃ ।। 10 ।।

lajjābījaṃ tataḥ paścāt tripurā ca tataḥ paraṃ ।
bhagavatī padaṃ paścāddantetha dvayamuddharet ।। 11 ।।

iyaṃ te kathitā deviṃ saṃjapā kullukā mayā ।
(7b)
athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi tacchṛṇuṣva priyaṃvade ।। 12 ।।

yasyā jñānena viphalaṃ japahomādikaṃ bhavet ।
viprāṇāṃ praṇavaḥ setu kṣatriyāṇāṃ tathaiva ca ।।

vaiśyānāṃ ca phadaṃ tasyāt māyā sūdrasya kathyate ।
mahāsetuśca deveśi sundaryyā bhuvaneśvarī ।। 14 ।।

kālikāyāḥ svabījaṃ tu tārāyāḥ kūrccabījakaṃ ।
antasāṃ tu vadhūbījaṃ mahāsetuvarānane ।। 15 ।।

ādau japtvā mahāsetuṃ japetmantramananyadhīḥ ।
dhanya dhanya śaturlyasau vāṇyā vāgīśvaropamaḥ ।। 16 ।।

yuddhe kṛtāṃte sadṛśo nārīṇāṃ madanopamaḥ ।
(8a)
japakāle bhavettasya sarvvakāle na saṃśaya ।।

atha vakṣyāmi nirvvāṇaṃ śṛṇuṣvāvahitānaghe ।
praṇavaṃ pūrvvamuccāryya mātṛkāṃ ca samuccaret ।।

tato mūlaṃ maheśāni tato vāgbhavamuccaret ।
mātṛkāṃ ca samastāṃ tu punaḥ praṇavamuccaret ।।

evaṃ utitamūlaṃ tu prajapenmantipūrake ।
evaṃ nirvvāṇamīśāni yo na jānāti yāmaraḥ ।।

varṣakoṭiśatenāpi tasya siddhirna jāyate ।
tasmāt sarvvaprayatnena yaduktaṃ tanmaheśvarī ।।

tattadācāryavidhivajjapenmaṃtramanuttamaṃ ।
ṣanmāsānsiddhimāpnoti nātrakāryā vicāraṇā ।।

sākṣāt sa eva jagatāmadhīso nātrasaṃśayaḥ ।
saraṇyaḥ sa ca vijñāna sa ca maṃtrasya tatvavit ।।

sa eva nivṛto bhūmau vicareṃtu yathāgṛhe ।
tasya {darśanamātrena parāyante ca vairiṇaḥ ।।

evaṃ kṛtvā kavaca uditaṃ yo japet mantrarājaṃ
taṇirvvāṇaṃ bhavamāhate kullukāṃ tāni japtvā ।
teṣāṃ tadvaśikhila bhavaniṃ siddhiyoṣṭhau ca haste
snehāntatvaṃ vacasi vacanaṃ padmapadmotare ca ।। 25 ।।

।। iti rudrayāmale kullukā samāptaṃ ।।}
(8b)
1 oṃ namo bhagavatyai ।।

śivaḥ śaktyāyukto yadi bhavati śaktaḥ prabhavituṃ ।
na ca devaṃ devo na khalu kuśalaspanditumapi ।।
atastvāmārādhyāṃ hariharaviriṃcyādibhirapi ।
praṇaṃstuṃ stotuṃ vā katha{ma}kṛtapuṇyaḥ prabhavati ।। 1 ।।

tanīyāṅgaṃ pāṅguṃ tava caraṇapaṅkeruhabhavaṃ ।
viriñciḥ saṃvinvanaviracayati lokānavikalaṃ ।।
vahatyenaṃ śauriḥ kathamapi sahasreṇa śirasā ।
haraḥ saṃkṣobhyainaṃ bhajati bhasitoddhūlanavidhiṃ ।। 2 ।।

avidyānāmantastimiramihiradvīpanagarī ।
jaḍānāṃ caitanyastavakamakarandaśrutiśirā ।।
(9a)
daridrānāṃ cintāmaṇi guṇanikā janmajaladhau ।
nimagnānāṃ daṃṣṭrāmuraripuvarāhasya bhavatī ।। 3 ।।

tvadanyaḥ pāṇibhyāmabhayavarado daivatagaṇa-
stvamekā naivāsi prakaṭitavarābhītyabhinayā ।।
bhayāttrātuṃ dātuṃ phalamapi ca vāṃcchāsamadhikaṃ
śaraṇye lokānāṃ tava hi caraṇāveva nipuṇau ।। 4 ।।

haristvāmārādhya pranatajanasaubhāgyajananī ।
purānārī bhūtvā puraripumapi kṣobhamanayat ।।
smaropi tvāṃ natvā ratinayanalehyena vapuṣā ।
munīnāmapyantaḥ prabhavati hi mohāya jagatāṃ ।। 5 ।।

dhanuḥ pauṣyaṃ maurvvī madhukaramayī pañcaviśikhā ।
(9b)
vasantaḥ sāmanto malayamarudāyo dhanarathaḥ ।।
tathāpyekaḥ sarvvaṃ himagirisute kāmapi kṛpā-
mapāṅgātte labdhā jagadidamanaṃgo vijayate ।। 6 ।।

kvaṇatkāñcīdāmākarikalabhakumbhastanabharā ।
parikṣīṇā madhye parinataśaraccandravadanā ।।
dhanurbāṇān pāśaṃ śṛṇimapi dadhānā karatalaiḥ ।
purastādāstāṃ naḥ puramathiturāho puruḥpikā ।। 7 ।।

sudhāsiṃdhormmadhye suraviṭapivāṭīparivṛte ।
maṇidvīpe nipopavanavaticintāmaṇigṛhe ।।
śivākāre maṃce paramaśivaparyaṅkanilayāṃ ।
(10a)
bhajanti tvāṃ dhanyāḥ kati kati cidānandaraharīṃ ।। 8 ।।

mahīmūlādhārekamapi maṇipūre hutavahaṃ ।
sthitaṃ svādhiṣṭhāne hṛdi marutamākāśamupari ।।
manopi bhrūmadhye sakalamapi bhitvā kulapathaṃ ।
sahasrāre padme sarahasi patyā viharasi ।। 9 ।।

sudhādhārāsāraiścaraṇakamalāntarvvigalitaiḥ ।
prapañcaṃ siñcantī punarapi rasāmnāyamahasā ।।
avāpya svāṃ bhūmiṃ bhujaganibhamatyuṣṭavalayaṃ ।
svamātmānaṃ kṛtvā svapiṣi kulakuṇḍe kuhariṇi ।। 10 ।।

caturbhiḥ śrīkaṇṭhaiḥ śivayuvatibhiḥ paṃcabhiradhaḥ ।
(10b)
prapannābhiḥ śambhornnavabhiriti mūlaprakṛtibhiḥ ।।
trayaścatvāriṃśadvasudalakalābjatrivalaye ।
trilekhābhiḥ sārddhaṃ tava bhavanakoṇā pariṇatāḥ ।। 11 ।।

tvadīyaṃ saundaryaṃ tu himagirikanye kathayituṃ
kavīndrāḥ kalpante kathamapi viriṃciprabhṛtayaḥ ।
yadā lokyautsukyādamaralalanā yānti manasā
tapobhirduḥprāyāmapi giriśasāyujyapadavīṃ ।। 12 ।।

naraṃ vārṣiyāṃśaṃ nayanavirasaṃ narmasutajaṃ ।
tavāpāṃgāloke patitamanudhāvanti śataśaḥ ।।
galadveṇībaṃdhāḥ kucakalaśavisraṣṭasicayā ।
haṭhāt tryuṭyatkāṃcyo vigalitadukūlā yuvatayaḥ ।। 13 ।।
(11a)
kṣitau ṣaṭpaṃcāśadvisamadhikapaṃcāśadudake ।
hutāse dvāṣaṣṭhiścaturadhikapaṃcāśadanile ।।
divi dviḥṣaṭtriṃśanmanasi ca catuḥṣaṣṭhiriti ye ।
mayūṣāsteṣāmapyupari tava pādāmbujayugaṃ ।। 14 ।।

śarajjyotsnā śubhrāṃ śaśiyutajaṭājūṭamukuṭāṃ ।
varatrāṇatrāṇasphaṭikaguṭikā pustakakarāṃ ।।
sakṛnnatvā na tvāṃ kathamapi satāṃ sannidadhate ।
madhukṣīrā drākṣā madhumadhurīṇā bhaṇitayaḥ ।। 15 ।।

kavīndrāṇāṃ cetaḥ kamalavanavālātaparuciṃ ।
bhajante ye santaḥ katicidaruṇāmeva bhavatīṃ ।।
(11b)
viriṃcipreyasyāstaruṇataraśṛṃgāraraharī ।
gabhīrābhirvvāgbhirvvidadhati sabhāraṃjanamamī ।। 16 ।।

savitrībhirvvācāṃ śaśimaṇiśilābhaṅgarucibhi-
rvvaśinyādyābhistvāṃ sahajanani saṃcintayati yaḥ ।।
sakarttā kāvyānāṃ bhavati mahatāṃ bhaṅgi subhagai-
rvvacobhirvvāgdevī vadanakamalo modamadhuraiḥ ।। 17 ।।

tanucchāyābhiste taruṇataraṇiḥ śrīsaraṇibhi-
rddivaṃ sarvvāmurvvīmaruṇamaṇimagnāṃ smarati yaḥ ।।
bhavantyasya trasyadvanahariṇaśālīnanayanāḥ ।
sahorvvaśyāḥ vaśyāḥ kati kati na gīrvvāṇagaṇikāḥ ।। 18 ।।
(12a)
mukhaṃ binduṃ kṛtvā kucayugamadhastasya tadadho ।
hakārārddhaṃ dhyāyeddharamahiṣi te manmathakalāṃ ।।
sasadyaḥ saṃkṣobhaṃ nayati vanitāmityatilaghu ।
trilokīmapyāśu bhramayati ravīndustanayugāṃ ।। 19 ।।

kirantīmaṅgebhyaḥ kiraṇanikurumbāmṛtarasaṃ ।
hṛdi tvāmādhatte himakaraśilāmūrttimiva yaḥ ।।
sasarpāṇāṃ darppaṃ śamayati śakuntādhipa iva ।
jvarapruṣṭaṃ dṛṣṭvā sukhayati sudhādhāraśicayā ।। 20 ।।

taḍillekhātanvīṃ tapanaśaśivaiśvānaramayīṃ ।
niṣaṇṇāṃ ṣaṇṇāmapyupari kamalānāntava kalāṃ ।।
mahāpadmātavyāṃ mṛditamalamāyena manasā ।
mahāntaḥ paśyanto dadhati paramāhlādalaharīṃ ।। 21 ।।
(12b)
bhavāni tvaṃ dāse mayi vitara dṛṣṭiṃ sakaruṇā-
miti stotuṃ vāñchān kathamapi bhavāni tvamiti yaḥ ।।
tadaiva tvaṃ tasmai diśasi nijasāyujyapadavīṃ ।
mukundabrahmendrasphuṭamukuṭanīrājitapadāṃ ।। 22 ।।

tvayā hṛtvā vāmaṃ vapuraparitṛptena manasā ।
śarīrārddhaṃ śambhoraparamapi śaṅke hṛtamabhūt ।।
tathā hi tvadrūpaṃ sakalamaruṇābhaṃ trinayanaṃ ।
kucābhyāmānamraṃ kuṭilaśaśicūḍālamukuṭaṃ ।। 23 ।।

jagatsūte dhātā hariravati rudraḥ kṣapayate ।
tiraskurvvanne tatsvamapi vapurīśastirayati ।।
sadā pūrvvaḥ sarvvastadidamanugṛhnāti ca śiva-
(13a)
stvadājñāmālamvya kṣaṇacalitayorbhrūlatikayoḥ ।। 24 ।।

trayāṇāṃ devānāṃ triguṇajanitānāmapi śive ।
bhavetpūjā pūjā tava caraṇayoryyā viracitā ।।
tathāhi tvatpādodvahanamaṇipīṭhasya nikaṭe ।
sthitā hyete śaśvanmukulitakarottaṃ samukuṭāḥ ।। 25 ।।

viriñciḥ paṃcatvaṃ vrajati harirāpnoti viratiṃ ।
vināśaṃ kīnāśo vrajati dhanado yāti nidhanaṃ ।।
vitandrāmāhendrīvitatirapi saṃmīlati dṛśāṃ ।
mahāsaṃhāresmin viharati sati tvatpatirasau ।। 26 ।।

japo jalpaḥ śilpaṃ sakalamapi mudrāviracanaṃ ।
(13b)
gatiḥ prādakṣiṇyakramaṇamadanādyāhutividhiḥ ।।
praṇāmaḥ saṃveśaḥ sukhamakhilamātmārpaṇadaśā ।
saparyyāparyyāyastava bhavatu yanme vilasitaṃ ।। 27 ।।

{dadāne dīnebhyaḥ śriyamaniśamīśānasadṛśī ।
mamandaṃ saundaryyastavakamakarandaṃ vikirati ।।
tavāsmin mandārastavakasubhage yā tu caraṇe ।
nimajjanmajjīvaḥ karaṇacaraṇaiḥ ṣaṭcaratāṃ ।।}

sudhāmayyāsvādyapratibhayajarāmṛtyuhariṇīṃ ।
vipadyante viśve vidhiśatamakhādyādiviṣadaḥ ।।
karālaṃ yat kṣetraṃ kavalitavataḥ kālakalanā ।
na śaṃbhostṛnmūlaṃ tava janani tāṭaṅkamahimā ।। 28 ।।

kirīṭaṃ vairiñcaṃ pariharapuraḥ kaiṭabhabhidaḥ ।
kaṭhore koṭīre skhalasijahijaṃ bhārimukuṭaṃ ।।
praṇamyedyeteṣu prasabhamabhiyātasya bhavanaṃ ।
harasyābhyutthāne tava parijanoktirvvijayate ।। 29 ।।

(14a)

catuḥṣaṣṭhyātantraiḥ sakalamabhisaṃdhāya bhuvanaṃ ।
tatastattatsiddhiprasaraparatantraḥ paśupatiḥ ।।
punastvannirbbandhādakhilapuruṣārthaikaghaṭanā ।
svatantraṃ te tantraṃ kṣititalamavātītaradidaṃ ।। 30 ।।

śivaḥ śaktiḥ kāmaḥ kṣitiratha raviḥ śītakiraṇaḥ ।
smarohaṃsaḥ śakrastadanu ca parāmāraharayaḥ ।।
amī hṛllekhābhistrisṛbhiravasāneṣu ghaṭitā ।
bhajante varṇāste tava janani nāmāvayavatāṃ ।। 31 ।।

smaraṃ yoniṃ lakṣmīṃ tritayamidamādyatavamano-
rnidhāyaike nitye niravadhi mahābhogarasikāḥ ।।
japanti tvāṃ cintāmaṇiguṇanibaddhākṣavalayāḥ ।
(14b)
śivāgnau juhvantaḥ surabhighṛtadhārāhutiśataiḥ ।। 32 ।।

śarīraṃ tvaṃ śambhoḥ śaśimihiravakṣoruhayugaṃ ।
tavātmānaṃ vande bhagavati navātmānamanaghaṃ ।।
ataḥ śeṣaḥ śeṣītyayamubhayasādhāraṇatayā ।
sthitaḥ saṃbandho vāṃ samarasaparānandaparayoḥ ।। 33 ।।

manastvaṃ vyomatvaṃ marudasi marutsārathirasi ।
tvamāpastvaṃ bhūmistvayi pariṇatāyāṃ na hi paraṃ ।।
tvameva svātmānaṃ pariṇamayituṃ viśvavapuṣā ।
cidānandākāraṃ śivayuvatibhāvena vravṛṣe ।। 34 ।।

tavājñā cakrasthaṃ tapanaśaśikoṭidyutidharaṃ ।
paraṃ śastraṃ vande parimilitapārśvaṃ paracidā ।।
(15a)
yamārādhyan śaktyā raviśaśisūcīnāmaviṣaye ।
nirāloke loko nivasati hi bhālokabhuvane ।। 35 ।।

viśuddhau te śuddhasphaṭikaviśadaṃ vyomajanakaṃ ।
śivaṃ seve devīmapi śivasamānavyasaninīṃ ।।
yayāḥ kāntyā yāntyā śaśikiraṇasārūpyasaraṇi-
rvvidhūtāntarddhvāntā vilasati cakorīva jagatī ।। 36 ।।

samunmīlat samvitkamalamakaraṃdaikarasikaṃ ।
bhaje haṃsa dvaṃdvaṃ kimapi mahatāṃ mānasacaraṃ ।
yadālāpādaṣṭādaśaguṇitavidyā pariṇati-
ryadā datte doṣāṅguṇamakhilamadbhyaḥ paya iva ।। 37 ।।

tava svādhiṣṭhāne hutavahamadhiṣṭhāya nirataṃ ।
(15b)
tamīḍe samvarttaṃ janani mahatīntāṃ ca samayāṃ ।।
yadā loke lokān dahati mahati krodhakalile ।
tavādrā yā dṛṣṭiḥ śiśiramupacāraṃ racayati ।। 38 ।।

taḍitvantaṃ śaktyātimiraparipanthisphuraṇayā ।
sphurannānāratnābharaṇapariṇaddhendradhanuṣaṃ ।।
tava śyāmaṃ meghaṃ kamapi maṇipūraikaśaraṇaṃ ।
niṣeve varṣantaṃ haramihirataptaṃ tribhuvanaṃ ।। 39 ।।

tavādhāre mūle sahasamayayā lāsyaparayā ।
navātmānaṃ vaṃde navarasamahāṭāṇḍavanaṭaṃ ।।
ubhābhyāmetābhyāmubhayavidhimuddiśya dayayā ।
sanāthābhyāṃ yajñe janakajananīmajjagaditaṃ ।। 41 ।।

(16a)
।। iti ānandalaharīstotraṃ samāptaṃ ।।

gatairmmāṇikyatvaṃ gagaṇamaṇibhiḥ sāndraghaṭitaṃ ।
kirīṭaṃ te haimaṃ himagirisute kīrttayatu kaḥ ।।
samīpe yacchāyā sphuraṇaśabalaṃ candraśakalaṃ ।
dhanuḥ saunāsīraṃ kimidamiti badhnāti dhiṣaṇāṃ ।। 1 ।।

dhunotu dhvāntaṃ naḥ stulitadalitendīvaracanaṃ ।
ghanasnigdhaślakṣṇaṃ cikuranikurambantava śive ।।
yadīyaṃ saurabhyaṃ sahajamupalabdhuṃ sumanaso ।
vasantyasminmanye balamathanavāṭī viṭapināṃ ।। 2 ।।

vahantī sindūraṃ prabalakavarī bhāvatimira ।
tviṣāṃ vṛndairvvandīkṛtamiva navīnārkkakiraṇaṃ ।।
(16b)
tanotu kṣemaṃ nastava vadanasaundaryyalaharī ।
parīvāhasrotaḥ saraṇiriva sīmantasaraṇiḥ ।। 3 ।।

arālaiḥ svābhāvyādalikalabhasaśībhiralakaiḥ ।
parītaṃ te vaktraṃ pariharati paṃkeruharuciṃ ।।
davatsmere yasmin daśanarucikiṃjalkarucire ।
sugaṃdhau mādyanti smaramathanacakṣurmmadhulihaḥ ।। 4 ।।

lalāṭaṃ lāvaṇyadyutivimalamābhāti ca vaya ।
dvitīyaṃ tanmanye mukuṭaśaśikhaṇḍasya śakalaṃ ।।
viparyyāsanyāsādubhayamapi saṃdhāya militaḥ ।
sudhālepasyūtiḥ pariṇamati rākā himakaraḥ ।। 5 ।।
(17a)
bhruvau bhugne kiṃcidbhuvanabhayabhaṅgavyasanini ।
tvadīye netrābhyāṃ madhukararucibhyāṃ dhṛtaguṇo ।।
dhanurmmanye savye tava karagṛhītaṃ ratipatiḥ ।
prakoṣṭhe muṣṭau ca sthagayati nigūḍhāntaramume ।। 6 ।।

ahaḥ sūte savyaṃ tava nayanamarkkātmakatayā ।
triyāmāmbāmante sṛjati rajanīnāyakatayā ।।
tṛtīyā te dṛṣṭirddavadalitahemābhyujaruciḥ ।
samādhatte saṃdhyāṃ divasanicayorantaracarīṃ ।। 7 ।।

viśālā kalyāṇī sphuṭarucirayogyā kuvalaye ।
kṛpāpārāvārā kimapi madhurā bhogalatikā ।।
avantī dṛṣṭiste bahunagaravistāravijayā ।
(17b)
dhruvaṃ tattaṃ nāma vyavaharaṇayogyā vijayate ।। 8 ।।

kavīnāṃ sandarbhastavakamakarandaikarasikaṃ ।
kaṭākṣe vyākṣepabhramarakarabhau karṇayugalaṃ ।।
amuṃcantau dṛṣṭvā tava navarasāsvādataralā ।
vasūyāsaṃ saṅgādalikanayanaṃ kiñcidaruṇaṃ ।। 9 ।।

śive śṛṃgārārddrātatri tava mukhe kutsanaparā ।
saroṣāṅgaṅgāyāṃ giriśavadane vismayavatī ।।
harāhibhyo bhītā sarasiruhasaubhāgyajananī ।
sakhī susmerā te mayi janani dṛṣṭiḥ sakaruṇā ।। 10 ।।

gate karṇātyarṇaṃ garuḍa iva pakṣāṇi dadhatī ।
purāṃ bhettuścittapraśamarasavidrāvaṇaphale ।।
ime netre gotrā dhavapati kulotuṃ sakalike ।
(18a)
tavākarṇākṛṣṭasmaraśaravilāsaṃ kalayataḥ ।। 11 ।।

vibhaktatraivarṇyaṃ vyatikaritanīlāñjanatayā ।
vibhāti tvannetre tritayamidamīśānadayite ।।
punaḥ sraṣṭuṃ devānadruhiṇaharirudrānuparatā ।
nrajaḥ satvaṃ vibhrattama iti guṇānāntrayamiva ।। 12 ।।

pavitrīkartunnaḥ paśupati parādhīnahṛdaye ।
dayāmitrai netrairaruṇadhavalaśyāmarucibhiḥ ।।
nadaḥ śoṇo gaṃgātapanatanayeti dhruvamamuṃ ।
trayāṇāṃ tīrthānāmupanayasi saṃbhedamanaghe ।। 13 ।।

tavāparṇe karṇe japanayanapaiśūnyacakitā ।
nīlīyante toye niyatamaṇimeṣāḥ saphalikāḥ ।।
(18b)
iyaṃ ca śrībaddhacchadapuṭakavāṭaṃ kuvalayaṃ ।
jahāti pratyūṣe niśi ca vidyayā praviśati ।। 14 ।।

nimeṣonmeṣābhyāṃ pralayamudayaṃ yāti jagatī-
tavetyākutsanto dharaṇidhararājanyatanaye ।।
tvadunmeṣājjātaṃ jagadidamaśeṣaṃ pralayataḥ ।
paritrātuṃ śaṅke parihṛtaniṣāstava dṛśaḥ ।। 15 ।।

dṛśā drāghīyasyā davadalitanīlotpalarucā ।
darīyānsaṃdīnaṃ snapaya kṛpayā māmapi śive ।।
anenāhaṃ dhanyo bhavati na ca te hāniniyatā ।
vane vā harmye vā samakaranipāto himakaraḥ ।। 16 ।।

arālaṃ te pāṇī yugalamagarājanyatanaye ।
(19a)
na keṣāmādhatte kusumaśarakodaṇḍakutukaṃ ।।
tiraścīno yatra śravaṇapathamullaṃghya vilasa-
nnapāṅgavyāsaṅgā diśati śarasaṃdhānadhiṣaṇāṃ ।। 17 ।।

sphuraṅgaṇḍābhogapratiphalitatāṭaṃgayugalaṃ ।
catuścakraṃ manye tava mukhamidaṃ manmatharasaṃ ।।
yamāruhya drudyatyavanirathamarkenducaraṇaṃ ।
mahāvīro māraḥ prathamapataye muṃjitavate ।। 18 ।।

sarasvatyāḥ sūktīramṛtalaharī kośalaharī ।
pibantyāḥ sarvvāṇi śravaṇaculukābhyāmavirataṃ ।।
camatkāraślāghācalitaśirasaḥ kuṇḍalagaṇo ।
jhanatkāraistāraiḥ pratiracanamācaṣṭa iva te ।। 19 ।।

asau nāsāvaṃśastuhinagirivaṃśadhvajapaṭi-
(19b)
tvadīyo nedīyaṣphalatu phalamasmākamucitaṃ ।।
vahannantarmuktāḥ śiśirataraniśvāsaviditāḥ ।
samṛddhyāyastāsāṃ vahirapi ca muktāphaladharaḥ ।। 20 ।।

prakṛtyā raktāyāstava sudati dantacchadarucaḥ ।
pracakṣe sādṛśyaṃ janayati phalaṃ vidrumalatā ।।
na bimbaṃ tvadvimbapratiphalanalābhādaruṇitaṃ ।
tulāmadhyāroḍhuṃ kathamapi vilajjeta kalayā ।। 21 ।।

smitajyotsnājālaṃ tava vadanacandrasya pibatāṃ ।
cakorāṇāmāsīdatirasatayā caṃcujaḍimā ।।
ataste śītāṃśoramṛtalaharīmandarucayaḥ ।
pibanti svacchandaṃ niśi niśi bhṛśaṃ kāṃjikadhiyā ।। 22 ।।
(20a)
aviśrāntaṃ patyurguṇagaṇakathāmreḍanajaḍā ।
javāpuṣpacchāyā janani tava jihvā jayati sā ।।
yadagrāsīnāyāḥ sphaṭikadṛṣacchaccharimayī ।
sarasvatyā mūrttiḥ pariṇamati māṇikyavapuṣā ।। 23 ।।

raṇe jitvā daityāna pahṛtaśivāstraiḥ karavibhi-
rnnivṛttaiścaṇḍāṅgostripuraharanirmālyavimukhaiḥ ।।
virañcīndropendraiḥ śaśiśiśirakarpūradhavalā ।
vilipyante mātastava vadanatāmbūlaśakalāḥ ।। 24 ।।

vipaṃcyā gāyantī vividhamavadātaṃ paśupate-
stvayārabdhe cakṣuṃ calitaśirasā sādhuvacanaiḥ ।।
tvadīyairmādhuryyairapalapitatandrīkalaravī ।
(20b)
mijāmvīṇāṃ vāṇī niculayati cole navabhṛtaṃ ।। 25 ।।

karāgreṇa spṛṣṭaṃ tuhinagiriṇā vatsaratayā ।
girīśenodastaṃ mukuradharayānākulatayā ।।
karagrāhyaṃ śaṃbhormukhamukuravṛttaṃ girisute ।
kathaṃkāraṃ brūmastava cibukanaupamyarahitaṃ ।। 26 ।।

bhujāśleṣānnityaṃ puradamayituḥ kaṇṭhakavaṭī ।
tava grīvā dhatte mukhakamalanāliśriyamidaṃ ।।
yataḥ śvetā kālā puruvahanajaṃvālimalinā ।
mṛṇālīlā nityaṃ vahati yadaho hāralatikā ।। 27 ।।

gale rekhāstrisro gamakagatigītaikanipuṇe ।
vivāhavyāladdhapraguṇaguṇasaṃkhyāpratibhuvaḥ ।।
virājante nānāvidhamadhurarāgākarabhuvāṃ ।
(21a)
trayāṇāṃ grāmāṇāṃ sthitiniyamasīmāna iva te ।। 28 ।।

mṛṇālīmṛdvīnāṃ tava bhujalatānāṃ catasṛṇāṃ ।
caturbhiḥ saundaryyaṃ sarasijatavaḥ stauti vadanaiḥ ।।
nakhebhyaḥ saṃtrasyan pramathamadanādandhakaripo-
ścaturṇāṃ śīrṣāṇāṃ sa mama bhayahastārpaṇadhiyā ।। 29 ।।

nakhānāmudyotairnnavanalinarāgaṃ vihasatāṃ ।
karāṇāṃ te kāntī kathaya kathayāmaḥ kathamamī ।।
kadācidvā sāmyaṃ bhajati kalayā hastakamalaṃ ।
yadi krīḍā lakṣmīcaraṇatalalākṣāruṇadalaṃ ।। 30 ।।

samaṃ devi sphandadvipavadanapītaṃ stanayugaṃ ।
(21b)
tavedantaḥ khedaṃ haratu satataṃ prastutamukhaṃ ।।
yadālokyāśaṅkākulitahṛdayo hāsajanakaḥ ।
muhustau herambaḥ parimṛśati hastena jhaṭiti ।। 31 ।।

amūte vakṣojoramṛtarasamāṇikyakalaśau ।
na saṃdehaspandānagapatipatāke manasinaḥ ।।
pibantau tau janmādaviditavadhūsaṅgamarasau ।
kumārāvadyāpi dviradavadanakrauñcadamanau ।। 32 ।।

vahatyamvastamveramadanujakuṃbhaprakṛtibhiḥ ।
samārabdhāṃ muktāmaṇibhiralāṃ hāralatikāṃ ।।
kucābhogo vidyādhararucibhirantaḥ śabalitāṃ ।
pratāpavyāmiśrāṃ puravijayinaḥ kīrttimiva te ।। 33 ।।
(22a)
tava stanyaṃ manye dharaṇidharakanye hṛdayataḥ ।
payaḥ pārāvāraḥ parivahati sārasvata iva ।।
dayāvatyā dattaṃ draviḍaśiśurāsvādya tava yat ।
kavīnāṃ prauḍhānāmajani kamanīyaḥ karayitā ।। 34 ।।

harakrodhajvālāvalibhiravalīḍhena vapuṣā ।
gabhīre te nābhī saraṇi hṛtajhamyo manasijaḥ ।।
samuttasthau tasmādacalatanaye dhūmalatikā ।
janastaṃ jānīte janani tava romāvaliriti ।। 35 ।।

yadetatkālindītanu tava taraṃgākṛti śive ।
kṛśe madhye kiṃcijjanani tava tadbhāti sudhiyāṃ ।।
vimarddādanyonyaṃ kucakalaśayorantaragataṃ ।
(22b)
tanūdbhūtaṃ vyomapraviśadiva nābhiṅkuhariṇīṃ ।। 36 ।।

sthiro gaṃgāvarttaḥ stanamukularomāvalilatā ।
nijāvālaṃ kuṇḍaṃ kusumaśaratejo hutabhujaḥ ।।
rate līlāgāraṃ kimapi tava nābhīti girije ।
virajvāraṃ siddhergiriśanayanānāṃ vijayate ।। 37 ।।

nisargakṣīṇasya stanataṭabhaveṇa kramajuṣo ।
namanmūrttarnnābho valiṣu śanakaistruṭyata iva ।।
cirante madhyasya truṭitataṭinī tīrataruṇā ।
samāvasthāsthemno bhavatu kuśalaṃ śailatanaye ।। 38 ।।

kucau sadyaḥ svidyattuṭahaḍhitakarpāsabhidurau ।
karṣantaudormūle kanakakalaśābhau kalayatā ।।
tava trātuṃ bhaṅgādudaramavalagnaṃ tanubhuvya ।
(23a)
tridhā naddhaṃ devi triṃvalilavalī vallibhiriva ।। 39 ।।

gurutvaṃ vistāraṃ kṣitidharapati{ṣpārvvati} nijā-
nnitambā{dā}cchidya tvayi haraṇarūpeṇa nidadhe ।।
atastavistīrṇo gururayamaśeṣāṃ vasumatīṃ ।
nitambaprāgbhāraḥ sthagayati laghutvaṃ nayati ca ।। 40 ।।

kavīndrāṇāṃścaṇḍāḥ kanakakadalīkāṇḍapaṭalī ।
subhābhyāmūrubhyāmubhayamapi nirjitya bhavatī ।।
suvṛttābhyāṃ patyuḥ praṇatikaṭhinābhyāṃ girisute ।
vijigye jānubhyāṃ vibudhakavikumbhadvayamapi ।। 41 ।।

purā jetuṃ rudraṃ dviguṇaśaragarbhau girisute ।
niṣaṃgau jaṃghete kusumaviśikho vāḍhamasakṛt ।।
(23b)
yadagre dṛśyante daśaśaraphalāḥ pādayugalī ।
nakhāgracchadmā naḥ suramukuṭapāśaikaniśitāḥ ।। 42 ।।

śrutīnāṃ mūrddhāno dadhati tava yau śeṣaratayā ।
mamāpyetau mātaḥ śirasi dayayā dhehi caraṇau ।।
yayoḥ pādyaṃ pāthaḥ paśupatijaṭājūṭataṭinī ।
yayorlākṣālakṣmīraruṇaharicūḍāmaṇiruciḥ ।। 43 ।।

himānī hantavyaṃ himagiritaṭākrāntirucirau ।
niśāyāṃ nidrāṇaṃ niśi ca parabhāge ca viśadau ।।
paraṃ lakṣmīpātraṃ śriyamapi sṛjantau samayināṃ ।
sarojaṃ tvatpādau janani jayataścitramiha kiṃ ।। 44 ।।

namo vācaṃ brūmo nayanaramaṇīyāya padayo ।
stavāsmai dvaṃdvāya sphuṭarucirasālaktakarate ।।
(24a)
asūyatyatyantaṃ yadabhihananāya spṛhayate ।
paśūnāṃmīśānaḥ pramadavanakaṃ kelitavare ।। 45 ।।

mṛṣā kṛtvā gotraskhalanamatha vailakṣanamitaṃ ।
lalāṭe bharttāraṃ caraṇakamale tāḍayati te ।।
cirādantaḥ śalyaṃ dahanakṛtamunmūlitavatā ।
tulākoṭikvāśaiḥ kilikilitamīśānaripuṇā ।। 46 ।।

padante kāntīnāṃ prapadamapadaṃ devi vipadāṃ ।
kathaṃ nītaṃ sadbhiḥ kaṭhinakamaṭhīkharparatulāṃ ।।
kathamvā bāhubhyāmupayamanakāle purabhidā ।
yadādāya nyastaṃ dṛṣadi dayamānena manasā ।। 47 ।।

nakhairnnākastrīṇāṃ karakamalasaṃkocaśaśibhi-
(24b)
starūṇāṃ divyānāṃ sahata iva te cālucaraṇau ।।
phalāni svestebhyaḥ kisalayakarāgreṇa dadatāṃ ।
daridrebhyo bhadrāṃ śriyamaniśamahnāya dadatau ।। 48 ।।

kadā kāle mātaḥ kathaya kalitālaktakarasaṃ ।
pibeyaṃ vidyārthī tava caraṇanirṇejanakalaṃ ।।
prakṛtyā mūkānāmapi ca kavitākāraṇatayā ।
yadā datte vāṇīmukhakamalatāmbūlavasatāṃ ।। 49 ।।

padanyāsakrīḍopari racayamivālabdhumanasaḥ ।
calantaḥ khelanto bhavanakalahaṃsā na jahati ।।
suvikṣepe śikṣāṃ subhagamaṇimaṃjīraraṇita-
cchalādācakṣāṇaṃ caraṇakamalaṃ cārucarite ।। 50 ।।
(25b)
arālā keśeṣu prakṛtirasanā mandahasita ।
śirīṣābhā citte dṛṣadiva kaṭhorā kucataṭe ।।
bhṛśaṃ tanvīmadhye pṛthurapi varārohaviṣaye ।
jagattrātuṃ śambhorjayati karuṇā kācidaruṇā ।। 51 ।।

purārāterantaḥ puramasitavyombhūccaraṇayoḥ ।
saparyyā maryādā taralakaraṇānāmasulabhā ।।
tathāpyete nītāḥ śatamakhamukhāḥ siddhimatulāṃ ।
tava dvāropāntasthitibhiraṇimādyābhiramarāḥ ।। 52 ।।

gataste maṃcatvaṃ druhiṇa harirudreśvara bhṛtaḥ ।
śivaḥ svacchacchāyā ghaṭitakapaṭapracchadapaṭaḥ ।।
tvadīyānāṃ bhāsāṃ pratiphalanalābhāruṇatayā ।
(26a)
śarīrī śṛṃgāro rasa iva dṛśāṃ dogdhi kutukaṃ ।। 53 ।।

kalaṅkaḥ kastūrīrajanikarabimbaṃ jalamayaṃ ।
kalābhiḥ karpūrairmarakatakaraṇḍaṃ niviḍitaṃ ।।
atastvadbhogena pratidinamidaṃ riktakuharaṃ ।
vidhirbhūyo bhūyo nibiḍayati nūnaṃ tava kṛte ।। 54 ।।

svadehodbhūtābhirghṛṇibhiraṇimādyābhirabhito ।
niṣevyāṃ nitye tvāmahamiti sadā bhāvayati yaḥ ।।
kimāścaryyantasya (tri)nayanasamṛddhiṃ bhṛlayato ।
mahāsaṃvarttāgnirvviracayati nīrājanavidhiṃ ।। 55 ।।

samudbhūtaṃ sthūlastanabhavapuraścāvahasitaṃ ।
kaṭākṣe kandarpaḥ kusumitakadambadyutivapuḥ ।।
harasya tvat bhrāntiṃ manasi janayāmāsa madano ।
(26b)
bhavatyāṃ ye bhaktāḥ pariṇatiramīṣāmiyamume ।। 56 ।।

kalatraṃ vaidhātraṃ kati kati bhajante na kavayaḥ ।
śriyo devyāḥ ko vā na bhavati patiḥ kairapi dhanaiḥ ।।
mahādevaṃ hitvā tava sati satīnāmavarame ।
kucābhyāmāsaṅgaḥ kuravakatarorapyasulabhaḥ ।। 57 ।।

śivāmāhurddevīṃ druhiṇagṛhiṇīmāgamavido ।
hareḥ patnīṃ padmāṃ harasahacarīmadritanayāṃ ।।
turīyā kāpi tvaṃ duradhigamaniḥsīmamahimā ।
mahāmāye viśvaṃ bhramayasi paraṃbrahmamahiṣi ।। 58 ।।

sarasvatyā lakṣmyā vidhiharisapatnyo viharate ।
rateḥ pātivratyaṃ śithilayati ramyena vapuṣā ।।
(27a)
ciraṃjīvanneṣa kṣayitapaśupāśavyatikaraḥ ।
paraṃ brahmābhikhyaṃ rasayati rasaṃ tvadbhajanavān ।। 59 ।।

nidhe nitye smere niravadhiguṇe nītinipuṇe ।
nirāghātajñāne niyamaparicittaikanilaye ।।
niyatyā nirmukte nikhilanigamāntaḥstutipade ।
nirātaṅke nitye nigamaya mamāpi stutimimāṃ ।। 60 ।।

(mama stutimityanena prāptaṃ sukartṛkatvaṃ stuterapākaroti ।)

pradīpajvālābhirddivasakaraṇīrājanavidhiḥ ।
sudhā sūte caṃdropalajalalavairarghaghaṭanā ।।
svakīyairaṃbhobhiḥ salilanidhisauhityakaraṇaṃ ।
svakīyābhirvvāgbhistavajanani vācā stutiriyaṃ ।। 61 ।।
(27b)
arthaṃ madīyamavalokya tatopi samyak ।
arthāntaraṃ samadhigamya na niṃdyametat ।।
atyantadurgamatare pathi saṃcarantaḥ ।
ślāghyo bhavanti kavayaḥ purataḥ prayātāḥ ।। 62 ।।

bhedo na te janani jātu janārddanena ।
vaikuṇṭhanāthaparatāpi kṛtātra tena ।।
mātarbhavāni karavāṇi tathāpi kāṅga-
mākuṃcitostu mayi te karuṇākaṭākṣaḥ ।। 63 ।।

।। iti saundaryyalaharī samāptā ।।
(28a)
1 oṃ namaḥ śrīgaṇapataye ।।  athāntaryāgaḥ ।।

atha tantrānusāreṇa ṣaṭcakrādikramādbhutaṃḥ ।
ucyate paramānandanirvvāṇaḥ prathamāṅkuraḥ ।।

merorbāhyapradeśe śaśimihiraśiraṃ savyadakṣe niṣanne ।
madhye nāḍīsuṣumnā tritayaṇamayīcandrasūryyāgnirūpā ।।
dhūstūrasterapuṣpaprathimatamavapuḥ kandamadhyācchirasthā ।
vajrākhyā vaktradeśācchirasi parigatā madhyame syājjvalantī ।।

tanmadhye citriṇī sā praṇavavilasitā yogināṃ yogagamyā-
nnūtātantūpameyā sakalasarasijānmerumadhyāntarasthān ।।
(28b)
bhitvā dedīpyate tadgrathanaracanayā śuddhabuddhaprabodhā ।
tasyāntarbrahmanāḍī haramukhakuharādādidevāntarasthā ।।

vidyunmālāvilāśā munimanasi lasattanturūpā susūkṣmā ।
śuddhajñānaprabodhā sakalasukhasamūhā vabhāsa svabhāvā ।।
brahmadvāraṃ tadāsye pravilasitasudhāsāraramyapradeśaṃ ।
granthisthānaṃ tadetadvadanamiti suṣumnākhyanāḍyālapanti ।।

athādhārapadmaṃ suṣumnāsyalagnaṃ ।
dhvajādho gudorddhacatuḥ śeṇapatraṃ ।।
adhovaktramudyatsuvarṇābhavarṇo-
rvvakārādiśāntairyutaṃ vedavarṇaiḥ ।।

(29a)
amuṣmindharāyāścatuṣkoṇacakraṃ ।
samudbhāṣiśūlāṣṭakairaṣṭakoṇaṃ ।।
lasatpītavarṇaṃ taḍitkomaloṅgaṃ ।
tadantaḥ samāste dharāyāḥ svabījaṃ ।।

caturbāhubhūṣaṃ gajendrādirūḍhaṃ ।
tadaṃkena vinārkkatulyaprakāśaṃ ।।
śiśoḥ śṛṣṭikārī lasadvedavāhu-
rmmukhāmbhojalakṣmī caturbhāgabhedaḥ ।।

vasedatra devī ca ḍākinyabhikhyā
lasadvedabāhūjvalā raktanetrā ।।
samānoditānekasūryyaprakāśā ।
prakāśaṃ vahantī sadā suddhabuddheḥ ।।

vajrākhyā vaktradeśe vilaśati satataṃ karṇikāmadhyasaṃsthaṃ ।
koṇaṃ tat traipurākhyaṃ taḍidiva vilasatkomalaṃ kāmarūpaṃ ।।
(29b)
kandarpyo nāmavāyurvvilasati satataṃ tasya madhye samaṃtā-
jjīveśo bandhujīvaprakaramabhihasatkoṭisūryyaprakāśaḥ ।।

tanmadhye liṅgarūpī drutakanakakalākomalaḥ paścimābhyo ।
jñānadhyānaprakāsaḥ prathamakiśalayākārarūpaḥ svayaṃbhūḥ ।।
bhidyatpūrṇendubimbaprakarakaravayasnigdhasantānahāsī ।
kāśīvāśīvilāsī vilasati saridāvarttarūpaṃprakāśaḥ ।।

tasyorddhaṃ visatantuśodaralasansūkṣmā jaganmohinī ।
brahmadvāramukhaṃ mukhena madhuraṃ saṃcchādayanti svayaṃ ।।
(30a)
śaṃkhāvarttanibhā navīnacapalāmālā vilāsāspadā ।
suptāsarvyasamā śivoparilasatsārddhaṃ trivṛrttākṛtiḥ ।।

kūjantī kulakuṇḍalīva madhuraṃ mattālimālāsphuṭaṃ ।
vācaḥ komalakāvyabandharacanābhedādibhedakramaiḥ ।।
svāsocchvāsavibhañjanena jagatāṃ jīvo jayā dhāryyate ।
sā mūlāmbujagahvare vilasati proddāmadīptākṛtiḥ ।।

tanmadhye paramākalātikuśalā śūkṣmātiśūkṣmā parā ।
nityānandaparasparā {ca} capalāmālālasaddīdhitiḥ ।।
brahmāṇḍādikaṭāhameva sakalaṃ yadbhāsayā bhāsate ।
(30b)
seyaṃ śrīparameśvarī vijayate nityaṃ prabodhodayā ।।

dhyātvaitanmūlacakrāntaravivaralasatkoṭisūryyaprakāśaṃ ca ।
cāmīśo narendraḥ prabhavati sahasā sarvvavidyā vinodī ।।
ārogyaṃ tasya nityaṃ niravadhi ca mahānandacittāntarātmā ।
vākyaiḥ kāvyaprabaṃdhaiḥ sakalasuragurūnsevate suddhaśīlaḥ ।। 13 ।। ।।

sindūrapūrarucirāruṇapadmamanya-
tsauṣumnamadhyaghaṭitaṃ dhvajamūladeśe ।।
aṅgacchadaiḥ parivṛtaṃ taḍidābhavarṇeṃ-
rvvādyaiḥ sabindulalitaiśca purandarāntaiḥ ।।
(31a)
tasyāntare pravilasadviṣadaprakāśa-
mambhojamaṇḍalamatho varuṇasya tasya ।।
arddhendurūpalalitaṃ saradindusubhraṃ ।
vaṃkārabījamamalaṃ makarādirūḍhaṃ ।।

tasyāṅkadeśe lalito harirevapāyā-
nnīlaprakāśaruciraśriyamādadhānaḥ ।।
pītāmbaraprathamajauvanagarvvadhārī ।
śrīvatsakaustubhadharo dhṛtavedabāhuḥ ।।

atraiva bhāti satataṃ khalu rākinī sā
nīlāmbujodarasahodarakāntiśobhāṃ ।।
nānāyudhodyatakarairlasitāṅgalakṣmī ।
divyāmbarābharaṇabhūṣitamattacirttā ।।

svādhiṣṭhānākhyametatsarasijamamalaṃ cintayadyo munindra-
(31b)
stasyāhaṃkāradoṣādikasakalaripuḥ kṣīyate tatkṣaṇena ।।
yogīśaḥ sopi mohādbhutatimira ca ye bhānutulyaprakāśo ।
gadyaiḥ padyaiḥ prabandhairvviracayati sudhākāvyasaṃdohalakṣmīṃ ।। 5 ।।

tasyorddhe nābhimūle daśada{la}lalite pūrṇameghaprakāśe ।
nīlāmbhojaprakāsairupahṛtajaṭhare ḍādiphāntaiḥ sacandraiḥ ।।
dhyāyedvaiśvanarasyāruṇamidirasamaṃtattrikoṇaṃ tadbāhya ।
svastikākhaistribhirabhivalitaṃ tatra vahne svavījaṃ ।।

dhyāyenmeṣādhirūḍhaṃ navatapananibhaṃ vedabāhūjvalāṅgaṃ ।
tatkroḍe rudramūrttivilasati satataṃ śuddhasindūrarāgaḥ ।।
(32a)
bhasmāptāvibhūṣābharalasitavapuvṛrddharūpī trinetro ।
lokānāmiṣṭadātābhayalasitakaraḥ sṛṣṭisaṃhārakārī ।।

atreste lākinī sā sakalaśubhakarī vedabāhūjvalāṅgī ।
śyāmā pītambarādyairvvividhaviracanālaṃkṛtā mattacittā ।।
dhyātvaitannābhipadmaṃ prabhavati nitarāṃ saṃhṛtau pālane vā ।
vāṇī tasyānanābje vilasati satataṃ jñānasandohalakṣmīṃ ।। 3 ।।

tasyorddhe hṛdi paṅkajaṃ sulalitaṃ bandhūkakāntyujvalaṃ ।
kādyairdvādaśavarṇakairupahṛtaṃ sindūrarāgāñcitaiḥ ।।
(32b)
nāmnānāhatasaṃjñakaṃ surataraṃ vāñchātiriktaprabhaṃ ।
vāyormmaṇḍalamatra dhūmaśadṛsaṃ ṣaṭkoṇasobhānvitaṃ ।।

tanmadhye pavanākṣaraṃ ca madhuraṃ dhūmāvalīdhūsaraṃ
dhyāyetpāṇicatuṣṭayena lalitaṃ kṛṣṇādhirūḍhaṃ paraṃ ।
tanmadhye karuṇānidhānamamalaṃ haṃsābhamīśābhidhaṃ
pāṇibhyāmabhayaṃ kṛṣṇādhirūḍhaṃ paraṃ varaṃ vidadhataṃ lokatrayāṇāmapi ।।

atrāste khalu kākinī navataḍitpītā trinetrā subhā ।
sarvvālaṃkaraṇānvitā hitakarī samyagjanānāṃ mudā ।।
hastaiḥ pāśasuśūlaśobhanavarātsaṃbibhratī cābhayaṃ ।
mattā pūrṇasudhārasārdrahṛdayā kaṃkālamālādharā ।।
(33a)

etannīrajakarṇikāntaralasacchaktistrikoṇābhidhā ।
vidyutkoṭisamānakomalavapuḥ sāste tadantargata ।।
vonākhyaṃ śivaliṅgakopi kanakākārāṅgarāgojvalo-
mausūkṣmabhedadyumaniriva prollāsalakṣmyālayaḥ ।।

dhyāyedyo hṛdi paṅkajaṃ surataruṃ sarvvasya pīṭhālayaṃ ।
devasyānilahīnadīpakalikāhaṃsena śobhitaṃ ।।
bhānormmaṇḍalamaṇḍitāntaralasatkiñjalkaśobhābharaṃ ।
vācāmīśvara īśvaropi jagatāṃ rakṣavināśakṣamaḥ ।।

yogīśo bha[ga]vati priyānpriyatamaḥ kāntākulāsyāniśaṃ ।
(33b)
jñānīśopi jitendriyegaṇo dhyānāvadhānakṣamaḥ ।।
gadyaiḥ padyapadādibhiśca satataṃ kāvyāmbudhārāvaho ।
lakṣmīraṅgaśadaivataṃ parapure śaktiḥ praveṣṭaṃ kṣaṇāt ।। 6 ।। ।।

viśuddhākhyaṃ kaṇṭhe sarasijamamalaṃ dhūmradhūmāvabhāsaṃ ।
svaraiḥ sarvaiḥ śoṇairddalaparilasitairdīpitaṃ dīpabuddheḥ ।।
samaptaṃ pūrṇenduprathimatamanabhomaṇḍalaṃ vṛttarūpaṃ ।
himacchāyānāgo parilasitatanoḥ śuklavarṇāḥ svarasya ।।

bhujaiḥ pāśābhītyaṃkuśaparilasitaiḥ śobhitāṅgasya yasya ।
manoraṃke nityaṃ nivasati girijābhinnadeho himābhaḥ ।।
(34a)
trinetraḥ pañcāsyo lalitadaśabhujo vyāghracarmmāmbarāḍhyaḥ ।
sadā pūrvvo devaḥ śiva iti ca samākhyānasiddhaprasiddhaḥ ।।

sudhāsindhau śuddhā vilasati kamale sākinī pītavastrā ।
śaraṃ cāpaṃ pāśaṃ śṛṇimapi dadhatī hastapadmaiścaturbhiḥ ।।
sudhāṃśoḥ saṃpūrṇaṃ śaśaparirahitaṃ maṇḍalaṃ karṇikāyāṃ ।
mohānāmokṣadvāraṃ śriyamatiśirasastasya śuddhendriyasya ।।

iha sthāne cittaṃ niravadhi ca nidhāyāttasaṃpūrṇayogaḥ ।
kavirvvāgmī jñānī sa bhavati nitarāṃ sādhakaḥ śāntacetā ।।
trilokānāṃ svāmī sakalahitakaro rogaśokapramukta-
(34b)
ściraṃjīvī jīvī niravadhi paramadhvāntahaṃsaprakāśaḥ ।। 4 ।।

1 ājñānāmāmbujaṃ tantuhinakiraṇasamadhyānadhāmaprakāśaṃ ।
hakṣābhyāṃ vai kālābhyāṃ pravilasitavapurnnetrapatraṃ śusubhraṃ ।।
tanmadhye hākinī sā śaśisamadhavalā vaktraṣaṭkaṃ dadhānā ।
vidyāmudrāñca pāṇau ḍamarujapamanī bibhratī mattacittā ।।

etatpadmāntarāle vilasati ca manaḥ śūkṣmarūpaṃ prasiddhaṃ ।
yonau tatkarṇikāyāṃmitara śivapadaṃ liṅgacihnaprakāśaṃ ।।
vidyunmālāvilāśaṃ paramakulapadaṃ brahmasūtraprabodhaṃ ।
(35a)
vedānāmādibījaṃ sthiratarahṛdayaścintaye tatkramena ।।

dhyānātmā sādhakendro bhavati parapure śīghragāmī munīndraḥ ।
sarvvajñaḥ sarvvadeśī sakalahitakaraḥ sarvvaśāstrasya vettā ।।
advaitācāravedī vidalitaparamāpūrvvasiddhaprasiddho ।
dīrghāyuḥ sopi karttā tribhuvanabhavane saṃcitau pālane vā ।। 3 ।।

tadantaścakresminnivasati satataṃ suddhabuddhāntarātmā ।
pradīpābhajyotiḥ praṇavaviracanārūpavarṇaḥ prakāraḥ ।।
tadūrddhaṃ candrārddhastadupari vilasadbindurūpī makāraṃ ।
stadūrddhaṃ nādosau varadhavarasudhādhārasantānahāsī ।।
(35b)
iha sthāne līne susukhasadane cetasi paraṃ ।
nirālambāṃ badhvā paramagurusaṃvāsuviditāṃ ।।
sadābhyāsādyogī pavanasuhṛdāṃ paśyati kalā ।
tattanmadhyāntaḥ pravilasitarūpānapi padān ।।

jvaladvīpākāraṃ tadapi ca navārkkeṇa bahulaṃ ।
prakāśajyotirvvā gaganadharaṇīmadhyamilitaṃ ।।
iha sthāne sākṣādbhavati bhagavān pūrṇavibhavo ।
vyayaḥ sākṣī rāhuḥ śaśimihirayormmaśula iva ।।

iha sthāne viṣṇoratulaparamāmodamadhure ।
samāropya prāṇāṃ pramaditamanā prāṇanidhane ।।
(36a)
paraṃ nityaṃ devaṃ puruṣamajamādyaṃ trijagatāṃ ।
purāṇaṃ yogīndraḥ pravisati ca vedāntaviditaṃ ।।

layasthānaṃ vāyostadupari ca mahānandarūpaṃ ।
śivārddhaṃ śivākāraṃ śāntaṃ varadamabhayadaṃ surddhabuddhaprakāśaṃ ।।
yadā yogī paśyadgurucaraṇayugāmbhojasevāsuśīla-
stadā vāsāṃ siddhiḥ karakamalatale tasya bhūyāt sadaiva ।।

tadūddhe śaṃkhinyā nivasati śikhare sunyadeśe prakāśaṃ ।
visarggādhaḥ padmaṃ daśasatadalaṃ pūrṇapūrṇendu{su}bhraṃ ।।
adhovaktraṃ śāntaṃ taruṇaravikalākāntikiṃjalkapuñjaṃ
lalāṭādyairvarṇaiḥ pravilasitavapuḥ kevalānandarūpaṃ ।।
(36b)
samāste tatrāntaḥ śaśaparirahitaḥ suddhasaṃpūrṇacandraḥ ।
sphurajjyotsnājālaḥ prakarakara ca snigdhasantānahāsīḥ ।।
trikoṇaṃ tasyāntaḥ sphurati ca satataṃ vidyudākārarūpaṃ ।
tadantaḥ sūkṣmaṃ tatsakalasuragaṇaiḥ sevitaṃ pūjyamānaṃ ।।

sugopyantadyannādatisayaparamāmodasantānarāsī ।
paraṃ kuṇḍaṃ sūkṣmaṃ sakalaśaśikalā suddharūpaṃḥ prakāśaṃ ।।
iha sthāne devaḥ paramaśivasamākhyānasiddhaḥ prasiddhaḥ ।
kharūpī sarvvātmārasaviṣasahito jñānamohāndhahaṃsaḥ ।।
(37a)
sudhādhārāsāraṃ niravadhi vimuñcannatiparaṃ ।
yaterātmajñānaṃ diśati bhagavānnṛmalamate ।।
samāste sarvveśaḥ sakalasukhasantānaraharī ।
parīvāho haṃsaḥ parama iti nāmnā paricitaḥ ।।

śivasthānaṃ śaivā paramapuruṣaṃ vaiṣṇavagaṇā-
layantīti prāyo hariharapadaṃ kecitapare ।।
padaṃ devyā devīcaraṇayugalānandaraśikā ।
munīndrāpyanye prakitipuruṣasthānamamalaṃ ।।

iha sthānaṃ jñātvā niyatanijacinto naravaro ।
na bhūyāt saṃsāre kvacidapi savadhyastribhuvane ।।
(37b)
samagrā śaktiḥ syānniyatamanasastasya kṛtinaḥ ।
sadā kartuṃ * * * khagatirapi vāṇī vimalā ।।

atrāste śisusūryyasodarakalā candrasya sā ṣoḍaśī ।
suddhā nīrajasūkṣmatantuśatadhā bhāgaikarūpāparā ।।
vidyullāsasamānakomalatanurnityoditādhomukhī ।
pūrṇānandaparasparātivigalatpīyūṣadhānādharā ।।

nirvvānākhyakalāparātparatarā sāste tadantargatā ।
keśāgrasya sahasradhā vidalitasyaikaṃ sarūpāvatī ।।
bhūtānāmadhidaivataṃ bhagavatī nityaprabodhodayā ।
(38a)
candrārddhāṅkasamānabhaṅguravatī sarvvārkkatulyaprabhā ।।

etasyā madhyadeśe vilasati paramā pūrṇanirvvānaśaktiḥ ।
koṭyādityaprakāśā tribhuvanajananī koṭibhāgaikārūpā ।।
keśāgrasyātiguhyā niravadhi vigalatpremadhārādharā sā ।
sarvveṣāṃ jīvabhūtā munimanasi sadā tatvavodhaṃ vahantī ।।

tasyā madhyāntarāle śivapadamamalaṃ sāsvataṃ yogagamyaṃ ।
nityānandābhidhānaṃ sakalasukhamayaṃ suddhabuddhasvarūpaṃ ।।
kecidvrahmāvidhānaṃ padamatisudhiyo vaiṣṇavaṃ tallapantaḥ ।
(38b)
keciddhaṃsākṣametatkimapi sukṛtino mokṣamātmaprabodhaṃ ।।

hū̃ kāreṇaiva devīṃ yamaniyamasadābhyāsasīlaṃ susīlo ।
jñātvā śrīnāthavaktrātkramamapi ca mahāmokṣatatvaprakāśaṃ ।।
brahmadvārasya madhye viracayati satāṃ suddhabuddhasvabhāvo ।
bhitvā talliṅgarūpaṃ pavanadahanayogāttatkramenaiva kuptāṃ ।।

bhitvā liṅgatrayantatparamarasaśive sūkṣmadhāmni pradīpe ।
sā devī suddhasattataḍidivavila{sa}ttanturūpā svarūpā ।।
brahmākhye yo śive yo sakalasarajitaṃ prāpyade divyate tat ।
(39a)
mokṣānandasvarūpaṃ ghaṭayati ca sā sūkṣmatārakṣaṇena ।।

nībhyātāṃ kulakuṇḍalīṃ layavasājjīvena sārddhasudhī ।
mokṣadvāmaṇisuddhapadmasadane śaive pare svāminī ।।
dhyāyediṣṭaphalapradāṃ bhagavatīṃ caitanyairūpāṃ parāṃ ।
yogīndro gurupādapadmayugalālambī samādau yataḥ ।।

lākṣābhaṃ paramāmṛtaṃ paraśivāt pītvā punaḥ kuṇḍalī ।
pūrṇānandamahodayā kulapathāmūlatviśi sundarī ।।
taddivyāmṛtadhārayā sthiramatiḥ saṃtarpayeddevataṃ ।
(39b)
yogī yogaparaṃparāvaviditā brahmāṇḍabhāṇḍe sthitaṃ ।।

jñātvaitatkramamuttamaṃ yatamanā yogī yamādyairyyata ।
* * * gurupādapadmayugalāmoḍaprabodho dayāt ।।
saṃsāre sa hi janyate na hi kadā saṃkīyate saṃkṣaye ।
pūrṇānandaparaṃparāpramuditaḥ svāntaṃ satāmagraṇī ।।

yodhīte niśi sandhayo ratha divā yogī svabhāvasthito ।
mokṣajñānanidānametadamalaṃ suddhaṃ suguptaṃ kramaṃ ।।
śrīmacchrīgurupādapadmayugalālambī yatāntarmmanā-
stasyāvasyamabhīṣṭadaivatapade ceto narīnṛttate ।। 21 ।।
