1 jātasūtakamādau syādante tu mṛtasūtakaṃ ।
sūtakadvayasaṃyukto yo mantraḥ sa na sidhyati ।।

ādyantarahitāṃ kṛtvā mantramāvarttayeddhiyā ।
sūtakadvayanirmmuktaḥ samantraḥ sarvvasiddhidaḥ ।।

sāyaṃ tatra hitaṃ kṛtvā mantrayāvajjapeddhiyā ।
sūtakadvayanirmmu{ktaḥ} samantraśca sasiddhidaṃ ।।
jātasūtakaṃ u * yaṃ mṛtasūtakaṃ adhastāḥ * ।
(40b)

1 śrīgurave namaḥ ।।

bindau tadarddharodhinyāṃ nāde nādānta eva ca ।
śaktau punarvyāpikāyāṃ samanonmanigocare ।।
mahābindau punaścaiva tridhā cakraṃ tu bhāvayet ।। ।।

akāraśca ukāraśca makāro bindureva ca ।
arddhacandranirodhiśca nāde nādāntareva ca ।।

śaktiśca vyāpiṇīścaiva samanā unmane tathā ।
samanānte pāśajālaṃ unmanānte paraśiva ।।

(41a)
niroddhikā arddhendu ।। bindukalāpade ।। nādanādānte dhrupamaṇḍale ।। viṣapada unmani ।। paraśiva ।। ।।

।। atha caturddaśabhuvana ।। ।।

1 sahasradale dhyāna ।।

muḍe vyomasthapadme sakaladalayute yākinī bhairavīṃ tāṃ ।
yakṣiṇyākhyāṃ samastāyudhalasitakarāṃ sarvvavarṇāsamaṣṭīṃ ।।
ḍākinyā saptavaktrāṃ sakalasukhakarī sarvvadhātusvarūpāṃ ।
sarvvānne saktacittāṃ paraśivaraśikāṃ bhāvaye sarvvarūpāṃ ।। ।।

ṣaṭcakrayā dhyāna ।।

bhrūmadhyadindupadme dvidalavilasite śuklavarṇakarābje ।
(41b)
vibhrāṇāṃ jñānamudrāḍamarugasahitāmakṣamālāṃ kapālaṃ ।।
ṣaṭvaktrāmarjjasaṃsthāṃ trinayanalasitāṃ haṃsavatyādiyuktaṃ ।
hāridrānne prasaktāṃ sakalasulanutāṃ hākinīṃ bhāvayettāṃ ।। ।।

raktāṃgī raktanetrāṃ paśujanabhayakṛcchulakhaṭvāṅgahastāṃ ।
vāme phetaṃ dadhānāṃ caśakamapi surāpūritaṃ caikavaktraṃ ।।
atyugrāmugradaṃṣṭrāmarikulamathanī pāyasānne prasaktāṃ ।
kaṇṭhasthāne mṛtādyaiḥ parivṛtavapuṣāṃ bhāvayet ḍākinīnāṃ ।। ।।
(42a)
śāmāṃ śūlābjahastāṃ ḍamarugasahitāṃ tī(kṣmā)cakraṃ vahantīṃ ।
vyāsyāṃ raktātrinetrāṃ bhrukuṭipalilasadduṣṭadaṃtraṃ prabhābhiḥ ।।
diptāṃ tāṃ devadevīhṛdayakamalagāṃ raktadhātvaikanātha ।
śuddhātreṣu prasaktāmadhumadamuditāṃ cintayettāṃ prasannāṃ ।।

kṛṣṇe devīṃ trivaktrāṃ trinayanalalitāṃ daṃṣṭriṇīmugrarūpāṃ ।
vajraṃ śaktiṃ ca daṇḍaṃmabhayavarakarāṃ dakṣavāme dadhānāṃ ।।
(42b)
dhyātvā nābhisthapadme daśadalavilasatkarṇike * lānītāṃ ।
māṃsasthā gauḍabhuktotsukahṛdayavatīṃ sasmaret sādhakendraḥ ।। ।।

svādhisthānākhyapadme rasadalalalite vedavaktrāṃ trinetrāṃ ।
pītāṃbhāṃ dhārayaṃtīṃ triśiṣaguṇakapālābhayātmarttivarggāṃ ।।
medo dhātuṃ pratiṣṭhāmalimadamuditāṃ vaṃdinityādivītāṃ ।
dadhyanne saktacitāmabhimadayaphadā kāṃkinī bhāvayettāṃ ।। ।।

devīṃjyotisvarūpāṃ trinayanavirasat pañcavaktrāṃ sudaṃṣṭrā ।
(43a)
hastāṃbhojekṣucāpaṃ sṛṇimapi dadhatīṃ pustakaṃ jñānamudrāṃ ।।
mūlādhārasthapadme śikhilapaśujanonmādinīmasthisaṃsthāṃ ।
muṅgānne prītiyuktāṃ madhumadhudaditāṃ cintayettāṃ prasannāṃ ।। ।।

